data: {"id": "a028a4c5f926482e-thinking-parallel_evidence-2154", "run_id": "a028a4c5f926482e", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "让我基于已有工具结果进行因果分析。\n\n## 实体确认\n- **Pod**: `workload`，Namespace: `aiops-case-11`，UID: `1cc226c9-d72d-4505-a057-b5022eaf5111`\n- **Node**: `node2`\n- **Container**: `app`\n- **Service**: `workload` (ClusterIP 172.30.90.244)\n- **Pod IP**: 172.16.104.48\n\n## 已采集事实\n\n### 1. Pod 生命周期状态（kubectl_get_yaml）\n- **创建时间**: `2026-09-07T23:09:42Z`\n- **deletionTimestamp**: `2026-09-07T23:09:46Z`（创建后仅4秒触发删除）\n- **deletionGracePeriodSeconds**: `0`（立即终止）\n- **phase**: **`Running`**（而非 Terminating）\n- **finalizers**: **`[\"aiops", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1788823829686, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

