data: {"id": "a028a4c5f926482e-final", "run_id": "a028a4c5f926482e", "seq": 2159, "ts_ms": 1788823850561, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-11/workload` | Terminating | Pod被自定义finalizer 'aiops.lab/hold' 阻塞，尽管容器因OOM killed（exitCode=137）终止，但finalizer阻止了Pod进入Terminated状态，导致处于Terminating Stuck。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `pod.condition`: Ready=False (ContainersNotReady); `container.last_terminated_reason`: Error; `container.last_exit_code`: 137 (E137) | 确认容器因 OOM Kill 崩溃终止且 Pod 处于不可用状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | `container.resource_limit.memory`: 96Mi; `container.resource_request.memory`: 24Mi | 容器内存硬限制极低（96Mi），构成 OOM 高风险背景 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `fact-f9207a33d024`: `container.last_exit_code` 为 137; `fact-29d591deb0e5`: `container.resource_limit.memory` 为 96Mi | 直接关联 SIGKILL 信号与低内存限制事实 |\n| 4 | Logging | Elasticsearch | `log.message` 模式 `request completed` 持续成功；`allocated_mib`: first 0, last 0 | 显示崩溃前业务流量正常处理，内存分配量始终为 0 |\n| 5 | Tracing | Deepflow/Tempo | `GET /work` 耗时 3.6ms-19.6ms, HTTP 200, trace_ids 与日志匹配 | 验证业务逻辑本身未发生异常耗时或报错 |\n| 6 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `diagnostic_status`: \"Terminating\" (诊断描述提及) | 指出 Pod 虽崩溃但资源对象卡在清理阶段，未真正销毁 |\n\n**证据小结**：Kubernetes 状态与日志、链路显示应用运行正常但容器发生异常终止（OOM Kill）。虽然 exitCode 137 指向 OOM，但 `allocated_mib` 为 0 且内存限制极低，OOM 是合理的崩溃原因。然而，决定当前系统不可用（Terminating Stuck）的关键矛盾在于：Pod 对象因 `aiops.lab/hold` Finalizer 未清除而被 API Server 阻止进入 Terminated 状态，导致集群层面呈现“僵死”而非“崩溃重试”。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n```text\n容器内存限制过低(96Mi) → OOM Killer终止进程(exitCode=137) → Finalizer 'aiops.lab/hold' 阻止对象销毁 → Pod对象卡在 Terminating 状态，资源无法回收，集群呈现 Terminating Stuck\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：Pod `aiops-case-11/workload` 处于 **Terminating Stuck** 状态，根本原因在于存在自定义 Finalizer **`aiops.lab/hold`** 且未被清理。\n\n*   **现象解释**：虽然容器因内存限制过低（96Mi）触发了 OOM Kill（退出码 137），但 Kubernetes 的 Garbage Collection 机制无法移除该 Pod 对象，因为 Finalizer `aiops.lab/hold` 仍然挂载在 Pod 的 `metadata.finalizers` 中。这导致 Pod 即使已经崩溃，其资源对象仍保留在 API Server 中并显示为 Terminating，阻碍了集群资源的完全回收。\n*   **引用证据**：\n    *   容器崩溃事实：`exit_code=137` 和 `container.last_terminated_reason=Error` (证据 #1)。\n    *   状态卡住事实：诊断信息中明确指出 `Pod被自定义finalizer 'aiops.lab/hold' 阻塞...导致处于Terminating Stuck` (证据 #6)。\n\n**未确认因素**：\n*   谁设置了 `aiops.lab/hold` Finalizer 及其未清理的具体触发原因。\n*   导致容器收到 SIGKILL (exitCode=137) 的具体触发源（虽然 96Mi 限制极低，指向 OOM，但 `allocated_mib` 始终为 0，需进一步确认是否被外部强制干预）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.9m\n├─ 问题定位: 15.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 86.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-11/workload: 86.3s (Evidence 78.7s, RCA 7.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 13.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-11/workload**: pod-terminating-stuck\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 114.881, "metrics": {"run_id": "a028a4c5f926482e", "mttr": {"value": "1.9m", "seconds": 114.88796257972717, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-terminating-stuck", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-terminating-stuck"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 114887.96257972717, "llm_calls": 12, "llm_duration_ms": 103559.85951423645, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 14, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 15, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 16547.61242866516, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 10921.686887741089}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 15344.093799591064, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 86342.26179122925, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 13181.278944015503, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

